><ulink url="https://software.opensuse.org/ymp/KDE:Extra/KDE_Frameworks5_openSUSE_Tumbleweed/moodbar.ymp"
>openSUSE Tumbleweed</ulink
></para
></listitem>
<listitem
><para
><ulink url="https://software.opensuse.org/ymp/KDE:Extra/openSUSE_Leap_15.0/moodbar.ymp"
>openSUSE Leap 15.0</ulink
></para
></listitem>
<listitem
><para
><ulink url="https://software.opensuse.org/ymp/KDE:Extra/openSUSE_Leap_42.3/moodbar.ymp"
>openSUSE Leap 42.3</ulink
></para
></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</sect3>
<sect3 id="mandriva-packages"
